<title>SWEDEN: Sweden to auction 2.0 bln in 10-yr bond.</title>
<headline>Sweden to auction 2.0 bln in 10-yr bond.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1996-11-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sweden's National Debt Office invited bids on Wednesday for an auction of 2.0 billion crowns of 10-year bonds.</p>
<p>Bids have to be entered by 1130 GMT on November 27.</p>
<p>					     Loan 1038</p>
<p> Auction date			    November 27, 1996</p>
<p> Maturity date			   October 25, 2006</p>
<p> Coupon  (pct)			   6.50</p>
<p> Amount to the market (billions)   2.0</p>
<p> Settlement date			 December 2, 1996</p>
<p>-- Stockholm newsroom +46-8-700-1017</p>
</text>
